es) and a backlog worth 62% of annual revenue.","Capex roughly matches depreciation (1.1x, 2.3% of sales), a maintenance pace.","It has beaten earnings estimates by 10.4% on average."],"own":["Insiders own 14.5%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 80%.","Insider trading is two-way: 1 purchase and 3 sales over the past year, net $738K sold.","Shareholder yield is a modest 0.4% (0.5% in dividends)."],"people":["With about 8,300 employees, each generates about $278K of revenue, 0.8x the Industrials median, and revenue has grown 5.1% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $41K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $1.5M (5x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (2/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $3K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":59,"head":"Avoid: priced 85% above its fair value of $113.","pros":["ROIC 17.0% vs WACC 9.5%","FCF margin 14.8%","Net debt/EBITDA 1.4x","Altman Z in the safe zone","12-1 month momentum +10%"],"cons":["Trades 85% above fair value of $113","P/E 36.0x vs sector 24.1x","EV/EBITDA 21.9x vs sector 13.4x","P/FCF 35.5x vs sector 22.9x"],"flags":["Priced 85% above its fair value of $113"],"need":[],"buy_below":96.23,"vc":{"base":113.21,"base_src":"dcf","bear":84.43,"bull":153.93,"alt_median":89.48,"n_alt":2,"gap":0.2653,"dispersion":0.0617,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":24.0501,"ev_ebitda":13.39,"pfcf":22.9066,"pb":2.9489,"roic":0.0996,"gross_margin":0.2855,"fcf_margin":0.068,"div_yield":0.0143}},"mc_quantiles":[66.31,77.92,84.43,89.88,92.69,97.23,100.87,104.14,107.22,110.64,114.17,117.32,121.24,124.56,128.5,132.97,138.68,145.15,153.93,167.97,192.87],"mc_drivers":{"growth":0.616,"discount_rate":0.295,"terminal_growth":0.017,"exit_multiple":0.072},"ticker":"CR","date":"2026-11-13"}